                                                <rect key="frame" x="10" y="385.33333333333331" width="373" height="67"/>
                                                <string key="text">Whether you’re a tech expert, customer service champion, creative storyteller, or business strategist — if you believe in innovation, integrity, and impact, you’ll feel at home here.</string>
